**Triage proposal** (change the labels if it is wrong)
Category: copy  Priority: P3
Summary: The website embed is called "Voorraad op de website" in the docs, in Settings > Website, on the preview page and in the mail to the web builder. "Wagens op je website" says what a garage and its web builder actually see. The public API reference also leaves open what `own_first` does without `scope`.

## What should change

- The name of the website embed becomes "Wagens op je website" wherever it is the name of that thing:
  - the `/docs` menu and hub;
  - the website guide heading;
  - the link in the partner guide;
  - the title in Settings > Website;
  - the preview page;
  - the mail subject and body for the web builder.
- The `own_first` parameter of the public API says it only applies with `scope=all`, and that without `scope` only the dealer's own vehicles come back.

Dutch only: the other languages do not use the word.
